      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A giant eyeball roughly the size of a hume's torso approaches, walking on a mass of tentacles, other tentacles reaching out towards its prey. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 14, flat-footed 17 (+4 Dex, +7 natural)</p><p>hp 45 [70] (7d8+14)</p><p>Fort +4, Ref +6, Will +7</p><p>Defensive Abilities Auto-Reflect</p><p>Immune confused</p><p>SR 17</p><p>Weakness water, wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee 4 tentacles +10 (1d4+1)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Flash, Para-Stare, Self-Destruct</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 13, Dex 18, Con 14, Int 15, Wis 15, Cha 13</p><p>Base Atk +5; CMB +6; CMD 20 (24 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Alertness, Combat Reflexes, Weapon Focus (Tentacle), Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Climb +11, Intimidate +11, Perception +18, Sense Motive +11, Survival +12, Stealth +14; Racial Modifiers +4 Perception</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment dungeons</p><p>Organization small group (1-3)</p><p>Treasure standard</p><p>Origin Gather</p>"
